data: {"id": "c187fa4a337a4542-thinking-parallel_evidence-1608", "run_id": "c187fa4a337a4542", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，topology 查询成功。现在我有了完整的事实证据链。让我总结一下：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 身份与状态**\n- Pod: `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh`\n- UID: `c54b3bab-76ec-47fa-934e-04a8b48cae1a`\n- Phase: Pending，node: `<none>`\n- 创建时间: `2026-09-03T02:44:26Z`\n- 所有者: Deployment/workload -> ReplicaSet/workload-68c557d875\n\n**调度失败原因**\n- 关键条件: `PodScheduled: status=False, reason=Unschedulable`\n- 事件: `FailedScheduling` (33m, x14 over 98m) — \"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"\n- 根因: Pod 设置了 `nodeSe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788409729343, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

